        "text_W4YYQp": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "enlarge_text": false,
            "text": "<h2><strong>Awaken to Your True Self at the International Yoga Festival</strong></h2><p>Join us at the <em>International Yoga Festival 2025</em>, from <strong>March 9-15</strong> at Parmarth Niketan Ashram, Rishikesh—a sanctuary for healing, unity, and transformation on the sacred banks of the Ganga River in Rishikesh, India.</p><p>In the birthplace of yoga, where ancient sages, seers, and yogis sought enlightenment amidst the majestic Himalayas, this is your invitation to reconnect, recharge, and renew. Here, you’ll join a global family of seekers, co-creators, and conscious souls—all coming together to expand consciousness and bring healing to ourselves and our world.<br/><br/><strong>Why Join Us?</strong></p><p>✨ <strong>Uncover Your True Potential:</strong> Awaken the best version of yourself through transformative teachings, practices, and wisdom. Step into your power, ignite your inner light, and leave behind what no longer serves you.</p><p>🌍 <strong>Global Unity & Community:</strong> In a world often marked by stress, division and burnout, the importance of connection and community has never been more! Come and connect with like-minded, conscious yogis from every corner of the globe. Whether you’re on a path of personal transformation or searching for a new beginning, this is where friendships turn into lifelong connections.</p><p>🧘 <strong>Transform Your Body, Mind, and Spirit with World-Renowned Masters:</strong> Dive into teachings and practices led by the world’s top yoga teachers, wellness experts, and revered spiritual leaders. Reclaim your health, find deep clarity in your mind, open and health your heart, and reignite your connection to spirit. This is your chance to receive life-changing tools to live with energy, peace, and purpose every day.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
